Jude Shin (jshin53@calpoly.edu)

All parts of this program were completed.

I built off the code given for program 3, but I started making more changes 
that will be implemented in my final project. The main milestone that I wanted 
to complete was the maze generation. 

To change the view to FPS mode, press "f".
To animate the scene around the treasure chest, press "g".

There is one static orange light in the sky.
Another white light is following the FPS camera.
This bright spot can be seen from the bird's eye animation.
This is to allow the player to see everything when they are navigating the maze.

Collision detection was added for FPS controls.
